{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"This session is being continued from a previous conversation that ran out of context. The summary below covers the earlier portion of the conversation.\n\nSummary:\n1. Primary Request and Intent:\n   This session continues Phase 3A batch translation of C test bodies from `picoquictest/` into Rust `#[test]` bodies in `rs/fq/src/tests/`. The task covers 8 C source files:\n   1. `satellite_test.c` → `rs/fq/src/tests/satellite.rs`\n   2. `skip_frame_test.c` → `rs/fq/src/tests/skip_frame.rs`\n   3. `socket_test.c` → `rs/fq/src/tests/socket.rs`\n   4. `sockloop_test.c` → `rs/fq/src/tests/sockloop.rs`\n   5. `spinbit_test.c` → `rs/fq/src/tests/spinbit.rs`\n   6. `splay_test.c` → `rs/fq/src/tests/splay.rs` (already done, skip)\n   7. `stream0_frame_test.c` → `rs/fq/src/tests/stream0_frame.rs`\n   8. `stresstest.c` → `rs/fq/src/tests/stresstest.rs`\n\n   Translation rules: faithful + idiomatic Rust, use public API as designed, add `todo!()` stubs to `internal.rs`/`lib.rs` for missing APIs, helpers in `util.rs`, no `unsafe`, no placeholder bodies. Tests must compile; panicking on `todo!()` is acceptable.\n\n2. Key Technical Concepts:\n   - **C-to-Rust translation on `c2rust` branch** of picoquic QUIC library\n   - **Phase 3A**: test body translation (compile-only gate)\n   - **fugit time types**: `Instant<u64, 1, 1_000_000>` and `Duration<u64, 1, 1_000_000>` (µs resolution)\n   - **`tls_api_one_scenario_init_ex` / `tls_api_one_scenario_body`**: core sim-test infra in `tests/util.rs`\n   - **`TestTlsApiCtx`**: public fields `stream0_flow_release: bool`, `immediate_exit: bool`, `test_finished: bool`, `c_to_s_link/s_to_c_link: Box<TestSimLink>`\n   - **`TestSimLink`**: fields `jitter: u64`, `microsec_latency: u64`, `picosec_per_byte: u64`, `loss_mask: Option<u64>`\n   - **`CongestionAlgorithm`**: struct with `congestion_algorithm_number: u8`, referenced as `&'static CongestionAlgorithm`\n   - **`SpinbitVer